Title: Biker, 71, killed in six-vehicle crash near Loch Lomond
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Sgt Kenny Malaney', 'Text': 'Our inquiries are continuing to establish the full circumstances of what happened.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 19, 'EndChar': 97}}, {'Speaker': 'Sgt Kenny Malaney', 'Text': 'Sadly, the male motorcyclist died and our thoughts are with his family and friends.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 1, 'EndChar': 81}}, {'Speaker': 'Sgt Kenny Malaney', 'Text': 'The road would have been busy at the time and I would ask anyone who may have witnessed the crash, or who may have dashcam footage to contact us, external.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 1, 'EndChar': 153}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Police Scotland said the 71-year-old man died at the scene.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 54}}, {'Description': 'The drivers of the cars were not injured.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 55, 'EndChar': 91}}, {'Description': 'The road was closed for more than six hours for police investigations.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 69}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'several cars driving on a road under a cloudy sky'}]}
